# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command cophist
usage 1   cophist [<reg>] [<count>]     Coprocessor register history (default: all regs, last 16)

case a target that keeps none
target fake
covers 1
$ cophist
out 53
This core does not keep coprocessor register history.
status 0
action none
$ cophist R15 4
out 53
This core does not keep coprocessor register history.
status 0
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ cophist
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
end

case on venusrt
target venusrt
frames 3
covers 1
$ cophist
out 53
This core does not keep coprocessor register history.
status 0
action none
$ cophist 2
out 53
This core does not keep coprocessor register history.
status 0
action none
$ cophist R15
out 53
This core does not keep coprocessor register history.
status 0
action none
$ cophist NOPE
out 53
This core does not keep coprocessor register history.
status 0
action none
$ cophist 0
out 53
This core does not keep coprocessor register history.
status 0
action none
end
